10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=1  line=Enter your email, and we'll send you a 4 digit verification code you can enter here to sign in and create your account.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=2  line=From your dashboard, tap New Order to begin.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=3  line=We need to add a person to the order. You can add yourself, or invite a party member.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=4  line=To search for a rental item, first select a collection. The collections hold groups of like or similar items, that can come with variants, such as different sizes or colours.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=5  line=Select your rental starting date, and then your return date. For a one day rental, select the same day twice. You will see the start and end date, as well as the number of rental days you have chosen in the status bar. Review your order, taking a moment to check that your rental dates and the prices are correct.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=6  line=Please answer some questions for us here, so we can expedite the preparation of your rental items. Then when you arrive at the store to pick up your items, you are getting the fastest possible service. Also review and agree to our rental terms and agreements.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=7  line=Review your total, then continue to payment. Take a moment to check your rental dates and the price are correct.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=8  line=Enter your credit card details to complete your rental order.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=9  line=That's it — your order is complete. Your invoice is ready, and your items will be waiting for you at the store.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=10  line=You can always find your rental in your order history. And your current settings will be saved for your next visit.
10:48:16  Edit line      Rentify Demos Corp/ski-demo/help-videos/videos/01-first-time-ordering n=11  line=You can now logout, using our dropdown menu in the top right corner. Thank you for renting with Ski Demo. We hope you have a great time on the slopes!

